<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan buys Aug 1-10 jet fuel at around $197/T.</title>
<headline>Taiwan buys Aug 1-10 jet fuel at around $197/T.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) bought by tender 32,000 tonnes of jet fuel at around $197 per tonne for August 1-10 delivery, cost-and-freight Keelung or Shen Ao, a CPC source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender, which closed on June 24, was awarded to a western trader from among 10 offers.</p>
<p>In its last tender, CPC bought 32,000 tonnes of jet fuel at around $201 per tonne for July 1-30 delivery, c-and-f basis.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
